00:05:15,000 --> 00:05:21,000
A Bundle of Trouble: An Aurora Teagarden Mystery is a mystery,
tv movie, drama film directed by Kevin Fair.

2
00:10:30,000 --> 00:10:36,000
Aurora Teagarden and her boyfriend Martin are thrilled when they get
an unexpected visit from his niece and her new baby.

3
00:15:45,000 --> 00:15:51,000
Their excitement is short lived when his niece
disappears and the baby is left behind.

4
00:21:00,000 --> 00:21:06,000
Once again, Aurora finds herself drawn into a deadly investigation as
she risks it all to help Martin reunite with his family.

5
00:26:15,000 --> 00:26:21,000
Aurora Teagarden, played by Candace Cameron Bure.

6
