11
00:57:45,000 --> 00:57:51,000
Aurora Teagarden is a fictional character created by author Charlaine Harris.

12
01:03:00,000 --> 01:03:06,000
She is the protagonist of a series of eleven crime
novels written from 1990 to 2017.

13
01:08:15,000 --> 01:08:21,000
Hallmark Movies & Mysteries began  adapting the novels in 2014 for their original film series The Aurora Teagarden
Mysteries with Candace Cameron Bure in the title role, part of the network’s "Mystery Wheel" umbrella series.

14
01:13:30,000 --> 01:13:36,000
In the first book of the series, twenty-eight-year-old Aurora (Roe) Teagarden is a professional librarian at the Lawrenceton Public Library and belongs to
the Real Murders Club, a group of true crime enthusiasts who gather monthly to study famous crimes from the history of their Georgia town.

15
01:18:45,000 --> 01:18:51,000
The tone is emotional and mind_bending.
